msgstr "Aucune réponse ne correspond à votre recherche"

#: lib/web_web/live/legal_live.ex:261
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No e-mail provider is configured in this version: in development, e-mails stay in a local mailbox on the server and are not sent. Before production, the operator must configure one and name it here:"
